    "title": "Harvard MBA need-based scholarship",
    "body": "# Harvard MBA need-based scholarship\n\nRecord: SCH-004. Checked 19 October 2026.\n\nHBS provides need-based scholarship support to admitted domestic and international MBA students. It is program-specific and should not be assumed to fund Harvard CS or CSE degrees.\n\nApply for aid after admission. Individual eligibility, award value, deadline, renewal and stacking rules require confirmation. A published average award is not an applicant-specific estimate.\n\n- [Official need-based aid](https://www.hbs.edu/mba/financial-aid/tuition-assistance)\n- [August 2026 financial aid FAQ](https://www.hbs.edu/mba/blog/answers-to-your-top-questions-about-financial-aid-at-hbs)\n"
