    "title": "SCH-013 — Joint Japan / World Bank Graduate Scholarship Program (JJ/WBGSP)",
    "body": "# SCH-013 — Joint Japan / World Bank Graduate Scholarship Program (JJ/WBGSP)\n\nChecked: 20 October 2026.\n\nJJ/WBGSP funds citizens of eligible World Bank developing countries who hold unconditional admission to a **participating** master’s program. Benefits include tuition, monthly stipend, airfare, health insurance, and travel allowance (verbatim summary). Most catalog CS and MBA programs are not participating programs — verify the current participating-program list before planning around this award.\n\n2027 application windows on the World Bank site: Window 1 Jan 18–Feb 26, 2027; Window 2 Mar 29–May 21, 2027. Eligible-country lists change; verify China/Hong Kong/Taiwan status in the current PDF.\n\n- [JJ/WBGSP program hub](https://www.worldbank.org/en/programs/scholarships/jj-wbgsp)\n"
