    "body": "# SCH-002 — Knight-Hennessy Scholars\n\nChecked: 16 October 2026. Status: **2027 application closed**.\n\n[Official deadlines](https://knight-hennessy.stanford.edu/admission/preparing-your-applications/application-deadlines).\n\nThe published deadline for the 2027 cohort was **October 6, 2026, 1:00 p.m. Pacific Time**. Retain for completeness, not as an open Fall 2027 funding option. If the applicant already applied, the Stanford degree application is separate and must meet the applicable KHS degree deadline; the source specifies the earlier of that deadline or December 1, 2026.\n\nStanford graduate-program scope permits this record to be referenced from relevant CS and business research. Personal eligibility, exact eligible degree, funding amount and duration are not evaluated in this pass.\n"
