    "body": "# SCH-011 — P.E.O. International Peace Scholarship (IPS)\n\nChecked: 20 October 2026.\n\nIPS supports women from outside the U.S. and Canada for graduate study in the U.S. or Canada, with intention to return to their home country. Maximum award: $12,500 (verbatim). Needs-based. Application windows are published on peointernational.org — verify the 2027–28 calendar before applying.\n\n- [International Peace Scholarship Fund](https://www.peointernational.org/educational-support/international-peace-scholarship-fund/)\n"
